<title>USA: SEEC Inc Q4 March 31 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>SEEC Inc Q4 March 31 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>			    Mar 31     Mar 31     Mar 31     Mar 31</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>    Total revenues   819,830    322,302  2,622,665  1,029,265</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS) (383,065)   (46,770)  (396,389)  (341,945)</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>  per common share    (0.13)     (0.02)     (0.13)     (0.13)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	2,941,859  2,630,050  3,036,027  2,630,050</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said its net loss for the fourth quarter of fiscal 1997 included the planned post-IPO investments in building its sales and marketing and general infrastructure.</p>
</text>
